<title>CHILE: Chilquinta 1996 net climbs.</title>
<headline>Chilquinta 1996 net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean electricity distributor Chilquinta SA reported the following net earnings for 1996.</p>
<p>				1996		 1995</p>
<p> Net earnings	     25.19		10.28</p>
<p> Operating earnings	2.11		10.29</p>
<p> Non-operating earnings 23.24		 1.57</p>
<p> Revs			 18.21		53.41</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
